    "model": "deepseek-chat",
    "summary": "Release 823770eff4e9 replaces the demo Deployment image digest and updates two env values (redacted) in the pod template, plus version labels on Deployment/Service/ServiceMonitor. Decision preview is REVIEW. Two review-level findings: 35 unreserved pod CPU/memory requests may overstate free capacity, and KubeCPUOvercommit is firing. Capacity is modest (1 worker ready, ~2190m CPU available). Because the env values are redacted, reviewers cannot confirm they are not fault-injection settings (e.g. DEMO_STARTUP_FAIL or DEMO_ERROR_RATE); require explicit confirmation that only normal values ship. Also require post-sync verification of rollout status, the running image digest, and /version, and note that a Git revert commit plus Argo resync is the only valid rollback path.",
